ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 31127, Oct. 27, 2020>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on December 11, 2020.
Article 2 (Special cases regarding formulation of implementation plans)
The first implementation plan to be formulated after this Decree enters into force shall be formulated within 3 months after the comprehensive plan is established, notwithstanding Article 4 (2).


